 "category_zh": "古镇村落",
 "category_en": "Ancient town",
 "intro_zh": "江湾是一座具有丰厚的徽州文化底蕴的古村落，村中有保存尚好的御史府宅、中宪第等明清时期官邸，又有徽派民居滕家老屋、培心堂等。江湾钟灵毓秀，展示了婺源的文化特色。江湾景区新建百工坊、鼓吹堂、公社食堂等景点，能体会旧时手工艺匠人的传统技艺，观赏徽剧、婺源民歌等传统剧目，极具历史价值和观赏价值。",
 "intro_en": "Jiangwan is an ancient village with rich Huizhou cultural heritage. In the village there are well-preserved Yushi Mansion, Zhongxiandi and other official residences from the Ming and Qing Dynasties, as well as Huizhou folk houses such as the Teng Family Old House and Peixin Hall. Jiangwan bells are beautiful and show the cultural characteristics of Wuyuan. The newly built Baigongfang, Advocating Hall, Commune Canteen and other attractions in Jiangwan Scenic Area allow you to experience the traditional skills of old craftsmen and watch traditional repertoires such as Anhui opera and Wuyuan folk songs, which are of great historical and ornamental value.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
